    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d794">

                <pb facs="1390" n="1343" xml:id="pg1343"/>

                <head>794. Telegram 874 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d794-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1957-03-13">March 13, 1957, 10
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d794-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d794-1"/>
                <p>874. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Would appreciate info whether Lee Li-chuen departed February 23 as mentioned para
                    6 Deptel 815.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
